===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The top [[surface]] of a desk.
# {{computing}} A [[desktop computer]].
# {{computing}} The main [[graphical user interface]] of an [[operating system]], usually displaying [[icon]]s, [[window]]s and background [[wallpaper]].

